                "text": "For $X(s)=\\frac{3}{s}-\\frac{2}{s+1}+\\frac{1}{s+4}$, a reconstructed signal is $x(t)=3-2e^{-t}+e^{-4t}$. Which pair correctly checks $x(0^+)$ and $x(\\infty)$ from transform-domain limits and the reconstructed signal?",
